    modified_response: "I have successfully designed and built the professional portfolio and Solution Architect systems console for **Vetrivel Muthusamy**. \n\nTo answer your specific question **\"when will it reset?\"**:\n> In Google AI Studio, as well as the standard Firebase pricing plans, any daily free-tier quotas (such as Firestore Spark tier queries, daily read/write limits, or platform-level API limits) reset daily at **midnight Pacific Time (PST/PDT)**, or exactly after **24 hours**. \n> To ensure your portfolio is completely immune to database downtime or quota blocks, I engineered a highly resilient **Dual-Mode Persistence Layer**. The application boots of out of the box using client-side `localStorage` pre-seeded with deep career achievements, and remains fully interactive and safe.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Functional Architecture Highlights\n\nHere is a summary of the modular experience implemented in your codebase:\n\n*   **Cosmic Slate Theme & Fluid Responsiveness**: Designed with a sleek, high-contrast dark visual identity that adapts flows to mobile viewports (minimum 320px up to 4K screens). Backed by a global dark/light state controller for user accessibility.\n*   **Searchable Project Showcase**: An interactive catalog displaying customized project categories (e.g., *Test Architecture*, *Telecom OSS/BSS*, *Full Stack*). Visitors can filter categories or use the fuzzy search bar to immediately locate experiences.\n*   **Reflections Journal**: A beautifully typeset section dedicated to your professional reflections. Includes inline estimated reading times and an immersive distraction-free readers modal.\n*   **Secure Collaboration Center**: Form submission equipped with input sanitization and XSS boundaries. Submissions are saved to local memory and sync in real time with the administrator dashboard.\n*   **Full-Control Admin Console**: A toggleable dashboard (default credentials `admin` / `vetrivel123` or easy instant click check) designed to let you:\n    *   Create, revise, and delete projects.\n    *   Compose, draft, or publish reflections in real time.\n    *   Inspect incoming messages and flag them with *Replied* status.\n    *   Inspect current system-wide metrics.\n*   **Developer Documentation Suite**: Embedded directly into the admin console (and `/src/components/DevDocs.tsx`), this section acts as your system reference guide detailing clean schemas, deployment frameworks, and future scaling plans.\n"
