  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing a Blueprint**\n\nI\'ve got the basics down with Tailwind 4.0 variables and some great font choices: \"Plus Jakarta Sans\" and \"JetBrains Mono.\" Now, I\'m thinking of redesigning the page around an interactive blueprint: an \"Interactive Carrier Network Solution Blueprint & System Playground.\" It feels right to make this more distinctive.\n\n\n**Defining the Diagram**\n\nI\'m now concretely defining the \"Interactive Carrier Network Solution Blueprint\" as a visual grid of a telecom OSS/BSS architecture\'s four layers. Each layer will be interactive, revealing details, my related experience, and the technologies used when clicked. SVG and Tailwind grid frames will provide a clean presentation. I am also working on the Southbound layer, which encompasses the physical network topology.\n\n\n"
