cle CRM\", \"Mediation Queues\", \"Aria Billing\", \"Amdocs Integration\", \"Billing Rules\"],\n      description: \"Handles subscription lifecycle, service state activations, pricing calculators, billing streams, and transactional database integrity for millions of tier-1 carrier users.\",\n      failureCured: \"Post-release subscription mismatches resulting in partial billing leaks. Saved millions of leakage dollars in live networks.\",\n      businessImpact: \"Achieved zero post-release revenue-impacting defects across 4 critical enterprise rollouts.\",\n      tnmStandard: \"TM Forum TAM & SID customer data schema representation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      id: \"layer-4\",\n      name: \"4. Unified SLA Control & Client Portal\",\n      subtitle: \"Full-Stack Portal & Analytics Service Assurance\",\n      status: \"ACTIVE\",\n      techStack: [\"React 18+\", \"TypeScript\", \"Tailwind CSS\", \"Spring Boot\", \"DevOps Pipelines\"],\n      description: \"Constructs the end-user control deck, rendering real-time metrics, system health logs, SLA compliance records, and administrative controls (Console).\",\n      failureCured: \"Lack of executive SLA traceability. Developed full-stack cloud proofs-of-concept for real-time customer transparency.\",\n      businessImpact: \"Replaced slow manual status reports with atomic, live-refreshing digital blueprint interfaces.\",\n      tnmStandard: \"W3C Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA) and modular component architecture.\"\n    }\n  ];"
