  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing The Portfolio Build**\n\nI\'m thrilled; the build was flawless! I\'ve been focusing on the portfolio redesign, specifically the text and competency updates, to ensure it showcases the latest cutting-edge software tech.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the requested updates of the portfolio to reflect the latest technologies, implemented an elegant Light/Dark/System theme switcher, and integrated a copy-to-clipboard email mechanism with slide-in toast notifications.\n\n### \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Portfolio Redesign & Tech Evolution\n\n*   **Upgraded Tech Representation**: Enhanced the career blueprint and experience logs to showcase cutting-edge systems: **Java 21**, **Spring Boot 3.3**, **Docker & Kubernetes containerization**, orchestration on **AWS EKS**, real-time **Kafka Streams**, and high-density **TM Forum Open APIs**.\n*   **Dynamic Theme Switcher**: Replaced the basic boolean toggle with a customizable dynamic dropdown. Visitors can now choose between **Light**, **Dark**, or **System** settings. Selecting \"System\" binds a media query listener (`prefers-color-scheme`) to adapt automatically to system-level preference changes.\n*   **Interactive Copy-to-Clipboard & Toast Feedback**: Refactored the footer\'s email mechanism. Clicking copies `vetrivelm02@gmail.com` directly to the user\'s clipboard and triggers an elegant, animated **floating notification toast** in the bottom-right corner with responsive slide-in transitions.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 152370088
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
