t 3.3** Webflux pipelines, **Kubernetes (AWS EKS orchestrations)**, **Kafka Streams**, **Cypress API**, and **Selenium Grid** automated test decks.\n\n4. **Interactive \"Click-to-Copy\" Email Action with Toast Feedback (`/src/App.tsx`)**:\n   - Swapped the raw footer link with a modular, interactive triggers element. Clicking `Copy Email` writes Vetrivel\'s address to the clipboard.\n   - Injected a fluid viewport-aligned toast notification system in the bottom-right corner utilizing custom layout animations and automatically dismissing itself after exactly 2.8 seconds.\n"
