 **BT Retail Mobile Ordering System**: End-to-end customer order portal validations.\n*   **Storage Self-Healing Upgrade**: Implemented a caching validation check that automatically updates stale browser cash datasets with these high-fidelity projects upon reload.\n\n### 3. Integrated AI Vetriebot Knowledge Alignment\n*   The system-level integration with the **Gemini 3.5 Flash** server-side engine will now seamlessly present, source, and validate questions regarding your genuine billing, testing, and CSPO agility history to visitors querying the virtual assistant."
