  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Aesthetic Vision**\n\nI\'m now honing the portfolio\'s visual direction. The initial \"Minimalist Cosmic / Tokyo Cyberpunk / Swiss Luxury Hybrid\" concept is shifting. I\'m focusing on a clean, Swiss-inspired aesthetic, emphasizing ultra-high-end refinement. Black, white, and soft neutrals will be the core color palette. I am considering an elegant neon highlight or gradient for theme toggling.\n\n\n**Reimagining Layout Principles**\n\nI\'m now implementing the redesigned layout with a grid-based approach. The focus is on a high-end technical blueprint aesthetic. I envision thin slate-toned borders and refined spacing across the entire website. I am particularly focused on `Hero.tsx`, transforming the simulated console into an abstract dashboard within a luxury grid. The visualization in `InteractiveBlueprint.tsx` will be minimalist with circular accents, and the chart in `Milestones.tsx` will receive premium, gradient grid treatment. Project cards in `ProjectGallery.tsx` will be reimagined as bento-style panels with dark outline effects.\n\n\n**Designing Refined Interface**\n\nI\'m now implementing aesthetic enhancements to key sections. The blog articles will be rendered as a minimalist editorial feed with elegant date and category indicators, along with clean line delimiters. I\'m prioritizing ultra-exclusive proportions and a compact design for the contact form in `ContactForm.tsx`. I am also working on `App.tsx` layout and spacing, with elegant transition details and dividers. I\'m focusing on a clean, Swiss-inspired aesthetic for `Hero.tsx`.\n\n\n"
