  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Restarting Server Success**\n\nI\'m pleased to report the dev server restart was successful! Now, I\'m focusing on crafting a concise and elegant summary of the changes for Vetrivel. My goal is to maintain a friendly and objective tone while describing design choices conceptually, steering clear of any engineering-specific details, and excluding any sales-related information.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completely redesigned the portfolio into a premium, precision-crafted **Swiss-Modern Systems Schematic** theme. The updated layout pivots away from standard tech templates, adopting a luxury technical aesthetic featuring thin hairline borders, high-contrast layouts, spacious negative space, and custom micro-interactions.\n\n### \360\237\223\220 Visual & Architectural Redesign Highlights\n\n- **Swiss-Modern Typography & Grids**: Configured elegant, crisp displays utilizing generous spacing paired with fine vertical alignment lines, mimicking high-fidelity engineering blueprints. The global dark canvas transitions seamlessly to a soft-cream/off-white light theme based on user preference.\n- **Dynamic Systems Orchestrator Sandbox**: Transformed the static console box in the hero area into an interactive pipeline visualization. Visitors can now click through **Mediation**, **Billing Database**, and **SLA Assurance** segments to see simulated live data streams, real-time telemetry speeds, and processing speeds in action.\n- **Refined Carrier Timeline (\"Why Solution Architect?\")**: Reconstructed the career progression timeline directly with custom numbering blocks, vertical guide connectors, and bold phase milestones presenting Vetrivel\'s evolution into telecom OSS/BSS solution design.\n- **Interactive Layers Sandbox**: Redesigned the carrier layers diagram. It now presents a side-by-side technical breakdown, detailing verified software stacks, solved critical system outage events, and clear business value delivered.\n- **Sleek Analytical Visualizations**: Polished the trajectory Recharts models, making tooltips and custom charts elegant and responsive while maintaining full dark mode transparency.\n- **Editorial Memoirs Grid**: Restructured reflections into a minimalist, substack-style digest with custom article badges, reading-time indicators, and an ultra-clean full-article overlay reader.\n- **Precision Coordinates & Contact Deck**: Sleek layout for professional handles, direct call channels, and secure encrypted text submissions, framing the footer with clean carrier availability status badges."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 207553761
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
