  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering App Structure**\n\nI\'ve been mapping out the structure of `App.tsx` and it\'s looking promising! I have the Hero section, a career timeline component, interactive blueprints, and milestone charts outlined. There\'s also a project gallery, blog, and contact form. Now I\'m deliberating on where to fit the skill map component cleanly.\n\n\n**Integrating Skill Map Component**\n\nI\'ve decided the skill map component, which I\'ll call `SkillMap.tsx`, fits perfectly after `Milestones` and before `ProjectGallery`. I\'ve analyzed Vetrivel Muthusamy\'s domains and technologies. I plan to use D3.js or Recharts to visualize the 11+ years of experience in Telecom OSS/BSS, Mediation Middleware, BSS Subscription, and Automation & DevOps. I need to figure out appropriate skill categories.\n\n\n**Designing Skill Map Visuals**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the visualization design for `SkillMap.tsx`. I\'m leaning toward a combined approach: a Recharts `RadarChart` for a domain overview, displaying proficiency metrics in Telecom Core, Backend, QA, DevOps, and Architecture. Then, I\'ll integrate an interactive bubble matrix or treemap that shows the years of experience versus skill depth within each selected domain. I\'m exploring the best way to make the interactions user-friendly. I\'m excited by this approach.\n\n\n"
