  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have successfully implemented all requested changes to elevate your portfolio\'s performance, physical look, and interactive properties:\n\n* **Print-Optimized Stylesheet**: Created a media query block in `index.css` that resets layouts specifically when triggered via `Ctrl+P`/`Cmd+P` or saved to a PDF file. It turns grids into print-friendly columns, guarantees clean legibility, strips dark backdrops for low ink consumption, ensures perfect page breaks, and dynamically appends hyperlink targets to anchor elements for physical document reference.\n* **Header Help Tooltip**: Integrated a small, stylized printer indicator next to the **vetrivel.arch** logo in the header. Hovering over it transitions a clean, responsive tooltip explaining that the portfolio is custom designed to be exported as a professional PDF document.\n* **Transition Micro-Animations**: Configured smooth stylesheet values and custom elastic spring rotational transitions in `index.css` (`theme-icon-animate`) to animate the Sun, Moon, and Monitor icons smoothly when changing dark or light theme modes.\n* **High-Performance Lazy Loading**: Added a stateful `<LazyImage />` component with an native `IntersectionObserver` trigger that lazy loads project screenshots and assets with a beautiful, themed system-loader schematic animation as elements slide into active viewport frames."
